full-query: "You have a setup in AWS which consists of EC2 Instances sitting behind and ELB. The launching and termination of the Instances are controlled via an Autoscaling Group. The architecture consists of a MySQL AWS RDS database. Which of the following can be used to induce one more step towards a self-healing architecture for this design?"
